# Zynq PS-PL 工程（顶层 ps_pl_wrapper）的引脚约束：板载 LED。
#
# led_o[3:0] 由 block design 里的 u_rv32_ps/led_o 引到顶层，驱动源是核侧 MMIO
# 0x5000 那个寄存器 —— 固件 sw 进去，灯就变。详见 README「MMIO（核侧地址空间）」。
#
# 这个文件只管 LED。PS7 的 DDR/FIXED_IO 引脚这里没有约束 —— 领航者没有可用的 Vivado
# 板卡文件（create_zynq_project.tcl 探测的是 Digilent 的 Zybo，在领航者上永远匹配不上），
# 要走通这条 PS-PL 路得另找正点原子的 PS7 配置。第一版（裸 PL 控灯）不经过这里，
# 所以现在不影响。
#
# 校验方式：Vivado 里 report_io 看这几个脚，或 open_hw_manager 后上板看灯。

# Zynq 配置引脚，缺这两行 bitstream 生成会报 CFGBVS/CONFIG_VOLTAGE 未设置。
set_property CFGBVS VCCO [current_design]
set_property CONFIG_VOLTAGE 3.3 [current_design]

# 引脚号抄自正点原子领航者 ZYNQ 的官方约束（NAVIGATOR_ZYNQ_IO.xdc 的 PL_LED 段）：
# 底板 led[0]=H15、led[1]=L15，核心板 led=J16 —— 全板只有这 3 个 PL LED。
# 高电平点亮。
#
# LED_WIDTH 已经改成 3，三个灯全都有脚，没有悬空输出 —— 所以这里不需要降级 UCIO-1。
# （要改回 4 的话得同时改 rv32_soc/rv32_ps_top/rv32_ps_regs 的 LED_WIDTH 默认值、
#   create_zynq_project.tcl 里 create_bd_port 的 -from、tb_rv32_ps.v 的位宽，
#   以及 scripts/gen_led_demo.py 的 LED_MASK。）
#
# ⚠ 别照抄 Zybo Z7 的 M14/M15/G14/D18：在领航者上这四个脚分别是蜂鸣器、PL_UART 的
# txd、ATK MODULE 的 gbc_key、以太网 eth_txd[0]，烧进去会直接怼到那些外设上。
#
# 端口名的方括号必须用花括号包住：写成 [get_ports led_o[0]] 会被 Tcl 当成命令替换。
set_property -dict {PACKAGE_PIN H15 IOSTANDARD LVCMOS33} [get_ports {led_o[0]}]
set_property -dict {PACKAGE_PIN L15 IOSTANDARD LVCMOS33} [get_ports {led_o[1]}]
set_property -dict {PACKAGE_PIN J16 IOSTANDARD LVCMOS33} [get_ports {led_o[2]}]

# ===================== I2C (PS7 I2C0 routed to PL via EMIO) =====================
#
# This block comes from the PS-side I2C path and is unrelated to the LED pins above. It
# was once wiped by create_project -force while merging the PL side's new revision, so
# it is re-appended here. The matching block-design config lives in
# scripts/create_zynq_project.tcl (the blocks whose comments start with "I2C").
#
# The board I2C bus carries an EEPROM and an RTC (the vendor constraints file names this
# segment "IIC(EEPROM/ RTC/audio config)"; the "audio config" device is not driven by
# this project). Addresses an on-board scan found: 0x50 / 0x51 / 0x1A.
# => The bus pull-ups already exist on the board, so the FPGA internal weak pull-up is
#    NOT enabled here (to enable it, add PULLUP true to the -dict; ~50k, in parallel
#    with the external pull-ups).
#
# Pin numbers are taken from the vendor's NAVIGATOR_ZYNQ_IO.xdc: iic_scl = E18,
# iic_sda = F17. Both are PL bank pins, not PS MIO -- which is exactly why EMIO is
# required: the PS I2C0 hard core has no MIO pin assigned.
#
# The port names must match ps_pl_wrapper.v character for character (the names are
# auto-generated by the BD and were never renamed):
#     inout IIC_0_0_scl_io;  /  inout IIC_0_0_sda_io;
# If a name is wrong, Vivado only reports
#     WARNING:          [Vivado 12-584] No ports matched 'IIC_0_0_scl_io'.
#     CRITICAL WARNING: [Common 17-55] 'set_property' expects at least one object.
# Neither is an ERROR => the script keeps going, both pins end up completely
# unconstrained, and nothing is caught until bitstream DRC (NSTD-1 / UCIO-1), more than
# ten minutes later. So copy the name out of the wrapper, never from memory. The build
# script has a self-check for this name; it fails about ten minutes before the DRC does.
#
# WARNING: no control flow of any kind is allowed in this file. XDC is a restricted Tcl
#   interpreter: if / foreach / puts are silently dropped (only a CRITICAL WARNING
#   [Designutils 20-1307] is printed; no exception is raised).
set_property -dict {PACKAGE_PIN E18 IOSTANDARD LVCMOS33} [get_ports IIC_0_0_scl_io]
set_property -dict {PACKAGE_PIN F17 IOSTANDARD LVCMOS33} [get_ports IIC_0_0_sda_io]

# Navigator V3.4 baseboard, sheet 02_IO: J3.25 -> B34_L20_N -> R18.
# 原在 J3.11/N18，挪过来是为了和麦克风阵列共用那根 2x8 IDC —— J3 只有 37/39 两个 GND，
# 被阵列块全占了，J3 上任何别的东西都只能共用那根排线。J3.11/N18 让出来后是 MRCC 脚。
# Shared with RGB LCD G3. BANK34 is powered by VCCIO: requires VCCIO = 3.3 V, but
# ⚠ VCCO_34 从未实测，且本工程走 plain part（无 board file），Vivado **不会**校验
#   VCCO 与 IOSTANDARD 是否匹配 —— 「综合过了」不等于「板上对」。见 docs/board_io.md。
#
# PULLUP, not PULLDOWN. 传感器是开漏，只能把线拉低，所以必须有东西把它拉高。
# PULLDOWN 指向反了：没有外部上拉时输入恒为 0 —— 那不是"还没有边沿"，而是一个
# 永远不会触发的转速输入，上层固件只会报超时，给不出任何线索。板上有外部上拉时，
# 内部这个（~50k）只是并联，不改变什么。
# ⚠ 外部上拉必须接 3.3 V —— 拉到 12 V（风机上很常见）会超出 HR bank 的绝对最大值，打死 Bank34。
# ⚠ 未实测：板上零 bring-up 记录，那个外部上拉到底装没装是不知道的。如果 tacho 一直
#   没边沿，先量这个脚的 DC 电平，别先动固件 —— 卡在 0 正是这个错。
set_property -dict {PACKAGE_PIN R18 IOSTANDARD LVCMOS33 PULLUP true} [get_ports tacho_i]
# Circular9 synchronizes the asynchronous tachometer through tach_meta/tach_sync.
# The pad only drives that first synchronizer stage; subsequent paths stay timed.
set_false_path -from [get_ports tacho_i]

# Production: planar eight microphones, four shared DATA lines + CLOCK.
# 线序表见 docs/board_io.md §8，设计依据见 docs/pdm_array_spec.md。
# 全部在 J3 上，都是 Bank 34 —— ⚠ 与上面那批一样，VCCO_34 从未实测，本工程走
# plain part（无 board file），Vivado 不会校验 VCCO 与 IOSTANDARD 是否匹配。
#
# PDM_CLK 放 J3.36/V16 是**刻意的**：V16 是整条 2x8 排线上唯一与地（J3.37）相邻的
# 信号位。目标扇出到8只麦，是这条通路上频率最高的信号（2.5 MHz），最需要就近回流。
# 换任何别的排法都会让它失去这个位置 —— 不要重排。
#
# Split external window budget, both phases sampled 125 ns after drive edge.
# ASSUMED maxima, NOT measured: CLOCK output 10ns, PCB CLOCK 3ns, PCB DATA 3ns.
# IM73D122 tDV <=100ns; reserve FF setup 2ns and relative clock skew/jitter 2ns.
# DATA pad-to-D budget =125-10-3-100-3-2-2=5ns. See docs/pdm_shared_timing.md.
set_property -dict {PACKAGE_PIN V16 IOSTANDARD LVCMOS33} [get_ports pdm_clk_o]
# Four shared DIN assignments are listed at the end of this file.
#
# PULLDOWN，不是 PULLUP。麦装上时它推挽驱动，内部这个 ~50k 只是并联、不改变什么；
# 两只麦都不驱动时，下拉有助于定义电平；放电时间仍取决于实际RC。
# 悬空 CMOS 输入会拾噪，位流看着像随机数据，抽取输出逐样点都在变，
# frozen仅为PCM不变告警；共线另一只麦及线容可能掩盖缺麦，不能据此验收断线检测。
# ⚠ 内部这个是兜底，**载板上仍要按 docs/pdm_array_spec.md P-11 各加 100kΩ 下拉** ——
#   内部上下拉很弱，长排线上不足以压住串扰。
# Explicit datapath budgets cover A hold D and B CIC bit_q D without CE multicycles.
# bit_q samples every clk; only CONSUME_TICK is used. Other captures are discarded.
set_max_delay -datapath_only 5.000 -from [get_ports {pdm_din_i[*]}]
# -datapath_only suppresses STA hold checks; hold is a separate window proof.
# These are implementation guardrails, not complete external Setup/Hold acceptance.
# Routed conditional analysis: scripts/check_pdm_external_sta.tcl and
# docs/pdm_external_window.md. Its qualification-clock XDC is ANALYSIS ONLY.
set_max_delay -datapath_only 10.000 -from [all_registers -clock_pins] -to [get_ports pdm_clk_o]

# User-confirmed DIN1..4 -> CH0/1, CH2/3, CH4/5, CH6/7.
set_property -dict {PACKAGE_PIN T14 IOSTANDARD LVCMOS33 PULLDOWN true} [get_ports {pdm_din_i[0]}]
set_property -dict {PACKAGE_PIN Y17 IOSTANDARD LVCMOS33 PULLDOWN true} [get_ports {pdm_din_i[1]}]
# 2026-10-21: DATA ordering follows the user's PDM_48K_8ch reference XDC.
set_property -dict {PACKAGE_PIN W16 IOSTANDARD LVCMOS33 PULLDOWN true} [get_ports {pdm_din_i[2]}]
set_property -dict {PACKAGE_PIN T15 IOSTANDARD LVCMOS33 PULLDOWN true} [get_ports {pdm_din_i[3]}]
set_property -dict {PACKAGE_PIN N16 IOSTANDARD LVCMOS33} [get_ports rst_n]
set_false_path -from [get_ports rst_n]
